BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (or backfill a role through to the new starter's first day. Its aim is to help hiring managers) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (make good, fair and lawful hiring decisions quickly, and to give candidates a consistent and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 589 Td (respectful experience wherever they apply.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 567 Td (1.2 The manual applies to all permanent and fixed-term employees. It does not apply to agency) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (workers engaged through the temporary labour preferred supplier list, which is managed under) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 541 Td (POL-FIN-012 Procurement Manual, or to independent contractors, whose engagement requires an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528 Td (employment status assessment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 506 Td (1.3 Where local employment law sets stricter requirements, local law prevails. Country-specific) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 493 Td (notes are included where the process differs materially at Rotterdam, Austin or Penang.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 471 Td (1.4 Queries about this manual should be sent to recruitment@meridian-instruments.example.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 458 Td (General HR queries go to peoplehelp@meridian-instruments.example.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 433 Td (2. Principles) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 411 Td (2.1 We hire for capability and potential. Decisions are based on the requirements of the role,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 398 Td (assessed consistently for every candidate.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 376 Td (2.2 We are committed to equal opportunity. We do not discriminate on the grounds of any) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 363 Td (protected characteristic under the laws of the countries in which we operate, and we make) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 350 Td (reasonable adjustments for candidates who need them at any stage.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 328 Td (2.3 We move quickly. Our target time-to-offer is 30 working days from the date an advert) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 315 Td (closes, and we aim to give every interviewed candidate an outcome within five working days of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 302 Td (their final interview.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 280 Td (2.4 We protect candidate data. Candidate information is handled in accordance with POL-CORP-006) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 267 Td (Data Protection Policy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 245 Td (2.5 We are honest with candidates. Adverts, interviews and offer conversations should describe) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 232 Td (the role, the team and the working arrangements as they really are, including the realities of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 219 Td (shift work in Penang or customer travel in sales roles. Overselling a role leads to early) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 206 Td (leavers, and early leavers are expensive for everyone. Hiring managers should also be open) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 193 Td (about timelines and let candidates know promptly if the process is delayed.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 168 Td (3. Workforce planning and requisition approval) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 146 Td (3.1 Headcount is planned annually as part of the budget cycle. Approved roles are held in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 133 Td (headcount plan maintained by Finance and People.) Tj ET
