BT /F1 10 Tf 54 98 Td (Hiring managers raise a vacancy using Keel > Team > Requisition to Hire. The requisition) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 85 Td (records the job title, grade, cost centre, reason for hire, proposed start date, whether the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 72 Td (role is in the approved headcount plan and the salary range to be advertised.) Tj ET
